{"id":"424374","name":"白玉菇瘦肉肉丸汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/424374/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白玉菇","amount":"250g"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉丸","amount":"适量"},{"name":"高汤","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱段","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白玉菇切去部分蒂头。","img":"images/424374/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将菇洗净备用。","img":"images/424374/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"瘦肉切片后加入花生油抓一下。","img":"images/424374/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅下油煸炒一下菇。","img":"images/424374/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒均匀后加入盐调味。","img":"images/424374/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入高汤，没有高汤也可以用水。","img":"images/424374/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入猪肉丸。","img":"images/424374/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开后放入瘦肉片。","img":"images/424374/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅前加少许鸡精提鲜。","img":"images/424374/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放上香菜和葱段即可。","img":"images/424374/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/424374/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/424374/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}